 of the flocks in the troughs, that is, in the watering places where the flocks came to drink; and they bred when they came to drink.","tok":[{"t":"And he "},{"t":"set","s":["H3322"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"rods","s":["H4731"],"a":[2]},{"t":" which he had peeled in front of the "},{"t":"flocks","s":["H6629"],"a":[10]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"troughs","s":["H8268"],"a":[6]},{"t":", that is, in the "},{"t":"watering","s":["H4325"],"a":[7]},{"t":" places where the "},{"t":"flocks","s":["H6629"],"a":[13]},{"t":" "},{"t":"came","s":["H0935"],"a":[9]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"drink","s":["H8354"],"a":[11]},{"t":"; and they bred when they "},{"t":"came","s":["H0935"],"a":[15]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"drink","s":["H8354"],"a":[16]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":39,"text":"And the flocks bred before the rods; and the flocks brought forth young that were streaked, speckled, and spotted.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"flocks","s":["H6629"],"a":[1]},{"t":" bred before the "},{"t":"rods","s":["H4731"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; and the flocks brought "},{"t":"forth","s":["H3205"],"a":[4]},{"t":" young that were streaked, "},{"t":"speckled","s":["H5348"],"a":[7]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"spotted","s":["H2921"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":40,"text":"And Jacob separated the lambs and set the faces of the flock toward the streaked and all the black in the flock of Laban, and he put his own herds apart and did not put them with Laban’s flock.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Jacob","s":["H3290"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"separated","s":["H6504"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"lambs","s":["H3775"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"set","s":["H5414"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"faces","s":["H6440"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"flock","s":["H6629"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"toward","s":["H0413"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the streaked and all the black in the "},{"t":"flock","s":["H6629"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Laban","s":["H3837"],"a":[11]},{"t":", and he "},{"t":"put","s":["H7896"],"a":[12]},{"t":" his own herds apart and did not "},{"